            <listPerson>
                <person xml:id="WHE04" sex="2">
                    <persName>
                        <roleName/>
                        <forename>Clara Maria</forename>
                        <surname>Wheatley</surname>
                        <addName/>
                    </persName>
                    <birth when="1767">
                        <placeName/>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1838"/>
                    <occupation>OCCUPATION</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>This was probably the widow of Francis Wheatley DNB 1747-1801 who later
                            (25.6.1807) married Alexander Pope DNB 1763-1835, she appears in DNB as
                            Clara Maria Pope 1767-1838 (nee Leigh)</p><p>See also Philp, Radical
                            Conduct (2020) on her relationship to Eliza Soane. It is likely that the
                            entries for Wheatley in 1812 and 12817 refer to a child of
                            Wheatley's.</p>
                    </note>
                </person>
